# Performance

- Minimize recomposition; stable keys in lists; remember expensive calculations.
- Blur/shaders: selective surfaces only — not full-screen list backgrounds.
- Measure jank on mid-tier devices; use Macrobenchmark when available.
- Baseline profiles for production builds.
- No decorative GPU-heavy effects without fallback and budget approval.
- Reference: `docs/design/PERFORMANCE_VISUAL_BUDGETS.md`.
